<Layout title="About Cosmin Ghinoiu | Client Delivery, Implementation and AI" description="Nine years at Copyright Clearance Center delivering enterprise software to pharma and life-sciences clients, 50+ projects since 2022, and an independent production AI service since October 2026." current="/about/">
  <section class="about-intro section-wrap"><div><h1>I’m Cosmin. <br />I get complicated <br />delivery to work.</h1><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cosmin-ghinoiu/" rel="me">Connect on LinkedIn <Arrow direction="up-right" /></a></div><div class="about-opening"><p>I do my best work when delivery is complicated, when one piece of work can’t start until another is finished and the teams involved each see the same problem differently.</p><p>In those situations I work out what needs to happen and turn it into a plan people can follow. Then I keep everyone on that plan until it’s done.</p><p>That’s the work I’m looking for now, in a client delivery, implementation or service delivery role (permanent or contract), or as a defined project.</p></div></section>
  <section class="about-background section-wrap"><h2>My background.</h2><div class="prose"><p>I spent nine years at Copyright Clearance Center. I started as the first Romania-based support specialist for its enterprise product and finished as Lead Client Service Delivery Manager. Most of my clients were global pharma and life-sciences companies. Along the way I worked in technical support, client engagement and enterprise implementation. Starting in support means I know how the software actually behaves, which helps a lot when I talk to the people who have to introduce it and use it.</p><p>Between 2022 and July 2026 I led 50+ specialized delivery projects, including implementations, integrations, migrations, technical reviews and workflow redesigns, and I was the implementation and service manager for five strategic accounts worth over $2M a year in recurring licences. Every account I managed renewed, and the contractual service levels for availability, order fulfilment and support response were met throughout. I’ve delivered over 40 API integrations, from discovery and approvals through configuration and the operational support that keeps them within the agreed terms.</p><p>I’ve also run more than 100 live user and administrator training sessions, the largest for 400+ people. Training has been part of my delivery work the whole time, from explaining a single configuration to preparing a team to run the platform on their own.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Request my current CV <Arrow /></a>
    <div class="about-certifications" id="certifications">
      <h3>Certifications</h3>
      <ul role="list">
        <li>Project Management Professional (PMP), 2026</li>
